{"overview":"عمو تونی احساس می‌کند که برادرزاده‌هایش که بزرگ شده و مستقل شده‌اند، به‌تدریج او را رها می‌کنند؛ سپس روزی نوزادی بر درِ خانه‌اش می‌ماند. او که نمی‌داند چه کاری باید بکند، با آن‌ها تماس می‌گیرد و با هم طرح‌های دیوانه‌وار برای یافتن والدین کودک می‌سازند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Uncle Tony feels increasingly abandoned by his nephews, who have grown up and become independent. Then, one day, a baby is left on his doorstep. Uncertain of what to do, he calls on them, and together they hatch wild schemes to find the child's parents.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Pedro Antônio"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["BR"],"cast":[{"name":"Marcus Majella","role":"Tony","photo":"/xndToVHuk7RUidSF2Cdl7i3qv2j.jpg"},{"name":"Letícia Isnard","role":"Ângela","photo":"/kUaLR3Z2rS6quRZ6PYbHlfjKF65.jpg"},{"name":"Júlia Svacinna","role":"Patrícia","photo":"/4aUVc96FsZZtVtXSlIUUIzklgS3.jpg"},{"name":"João Kalume","role":"João","photo":"/3n680jWA4XNo66IcECglpr9oBxM.jpg","en":"João Barreto"},{"name":"Soffia Monteiro","role":"Valentina","photo":"/x9urtjc5Zh6mC9kjP5fnavTzRAt.jpg"},{"name":"Maria Eduarda Rodrigues","role":"Alice","photo":""},{"name":"Danton Mello","role":"Beto","photo":"/i0AIfi8y7hh1OV0OPLv7VEk9LPX.jpg"},{"name":"Ana Lúcia Torre","role":"Cecília","photo":"/29RIRV7mIm8twX748UMKzqfg8o1.jpg"},{"name":"Noemia Oliveira","role":"Martinha","photo":"/95yO42O7K3smHhKwiWbXc2Zxwwe.jpg"},{"name":"Clarissa Pinheiro","role":"Paula","photo":"/didPtKsD3Pg7YmDsNxHT8DPGqGz.jpg"},{"name":"Daniela Fontan","role":"Odete","photo":"/ozWqcSuZJk63uB7YnZk0Inyu77g.jpg"},{"name":"Débora Lamm","role":"Poliana","photo":"/vWfgqwBgAMd0CCpeCPDn9xuvl56.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":["m620683"],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1368568"}